{"generated": "2026-08-17 16:00", "curation": {"market": "<b>외국인 매수세 유입과 코스피 반등</b>\n최근 외국인 투자자들이 삼성전자와 SK하이닉스 등 반도체 대형주를 중심으로 수조 원 규모의 강한 매수세를 보이며 코스피가 7000선 안착을 시도하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPUnA0eUdDTWdzaXNFUmZfT3hYbkpkNmJNb01WbXJFTk5YdDUzdHdScDRWcUlYNVhFaXdudnQ1LUZ5emFyRTlwWGkzVXl1Tk56MVBEQ0c3OVRpeUtXTTdZb3JtVW5qWldTUVBiY3c3al92ZVk2RjZ2d2FWOXliNTNmc254eldzM21D?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE83UUZSNTBpOW9hanBhY3pjNDdkMEVvbkM0V1E1M081RHVMUTBuTnJaekFSVkhFYnIyV3JMUFJRbW9jb1Nfb2gyN0x5ZGJXd1ZxbF9LZ1BCb2Nqdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFBjclF4a0NvSzBXX056bzdKWl84SFRrcHJFcXZSTFVnN3ZVZVNfd3FsUnJzUVkyYTB5cUJUd3JfVXB0ZWMtbEVMMjhpTjl3V1NxektKVjBrU24zUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5zeDZEODl2bWZOWWZHaDZHb3hxVnZYZmpRejg0VDFlSWFYcE85Y3NQWTVHQldyN29VTV90QlNmUUM1dmtjLWo4UzRpOHB3Q0tialZESld4NXBlYjhFSG9WY3lwS3FpQUVH?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE9fNUpnTG8yT205akhNcHByZ0JPcU1LQXhyTTk4XzFJNnJrYW9obmRhLXd2UTNQd0hWV184X0JiQTVmcnZrU3VyRF9jck1KcEE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a>]. 이러한 외국인의 귀환은 국내 증시의 상승장 전환 기대감을 높이고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a>].\n\n<b>반도체 업황 회복 및 정책 지원 기대</b>\nAI 수요 회복 기대감 속에 반도체 ETF가 급등하고 추가 상승 전망이 나오는 등 반도체 시장이 활기를 띠고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE1HUkxDbGdtNjZ6UkM2clEyYXJHMnk4MFlyeWNnVFRiak13QkhaV3lwUEpHSjBKUkZ1RFpXVTlZNGhxUENjSjdJeUdDWlpORThJQ1dGVXZVMkp5YzBHam1vMVV3XzQyMHR5V0hPUnNjdnQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFB2SV9PeGdEcXZnOENhSkE4bW9JOUJjVVZMUXkxVkZGVFJWLWc1blpxTTh5M2RVMFRRT1Rxb1VLUWRFeUttelJqcndzMl9yUXdURXU